{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104382","id":2405135356,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PW3P8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104382","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104382.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104382.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104382","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104382/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104382/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104382/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/231dce31e48ae08be1f6c39f7a73bcf7bfd47aa5","number":104382,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix clicks when AudioStreamPlayer3D routes to an Area3D's reverb send","user":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR makes two changes to resolve issues when an `AudioStreamPlayer3D` plays its stream while routing to buses specified by an `Area3D`:\r\n1. `_update_panning` is now called immediately after starting the stream. This re-sets bus levels to ensure they are correct for the first few frames. (These levels may be initialized incorrectly due to the call to `start_playback_stream` ignoring the `Area3D`'s bus options).\r\n2. If the `Area3D` provides a reverb send but not a bus override, the `AudioStreamPlayer3D` would previously only output to the reverb send (and not its own bus). This has been fixed so that the stream now goes to both the reverb send and the `AudioStreamPlayer3D`'s bus.\r\n\r\nFixes #104337.\r\nFixes #96480.\r\n\r\n#### PS\r\nThis is obviously not the most efficient possible implementation for (1), as `_update_panning` is called twice in quick succession.\r\nA better solution would likely involve a larger rewrite clarifying `_update_panning`'s usage by making it `void`.\r\nThis tweak is presented along with a more generic `sends` parameter in #104096.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","n